  "description": "PIYVAY crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C52 H64 Dy4 N4 O24,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.563-3.753 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.02-104.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C56H70Dy4N6O24. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
